# Build context of demo/cloud/Dockerfile (docker build -f demo/cloud/Dockerfile . from the repository root): only
# v8b_rev5/ and demo/ are sent. v8b_rev5/ must arrive byte for byte with nothing extra, because make_overlay.py runs
# tools/verify_repo.py on it; hence only caches are dropped there. From demo/, local and run directories, build output,
# captures, logs, keys, certificates, CSRs and pins are dropped as well.
*
!v8b_rev5
!demo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
demo/**/local
demo/**/runs
demo/**/build
demo/**/node_modules
demo/**/.venv*
demo/**/.env
demo/**/*.pcap
demo/**/*.pcapng
demo/**/*.log
demo/**/*.key
demo/**/*.pem
demo/**/*.csr
demo/**/*.srl
demo/**/*.pin
demo/**/*.p12
demo/**/*.tar
